# ADDED BY THE SVAR PRODUCTION PLANNER PROJECT.
# NOT part of the upstream SVAR sources.
#
# The web fonts under planner-assets/fonts/ are checked against recorded
# sha256 values at build time (tools/planner-fonts.mjs), so a checkout that
# altered a single byte would stop the build rather than ship a broken face.
# Git's own binary detection already prevents that, but this project builds
# the same commit on Windows workstations where core.autocrlf is commonly on,
# and a guarantee worth having is worth stating rather than inheriting from a
# heuristic.
planner-assets/fonts/*.woff  binary
planner-assets/fonts/*.woff2 binary
